What is the output of the following program?
```java
class SuperItem {
    String category = "General";
    SuperItem() {
        display();
    }
    void display() {
        System.out.print(category + " ");
    }
}
class SubItem extends SuperItem {
    String category = "Special";
    // Synthesized default constructor SubItem()
    void display() {
        System.out.print(category + " ");
    }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        new SubItem();
    }
}
```

